      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "questionNumber": 10,
      "stem": "设 f (x ) 可导， $F ( x ) = f ( x ) ( 1 + | \\sin x | )$ ，若 F (x ) 在 x = 0 处可导，则必有 · · ( )",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "value": "$f ( 0 ) = 0 \\qquad $"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "value": "$f ^ { \\prime } ( 0 ) = 0 .$"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "value": "$f ( 0 ) + f ^ { \\prime } ( 0 ) = 0 .$"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "value": "$f ( 0 ) - f ^ { \\prime } ( 0 ) = 0 .$"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "answerStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
      "explanation": "解. 应选 (A)．设 F (x ) 在 x = 0 处可导，则 f (x ) · |sin x | 在 x = 0 处可导，由可导的充要条件知\n\n$$\n\\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0 ^ {-}} \\frac {f (x) \\cdot | \\sin x |}{x} = \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0 ^ {+}} \\frac {f (x) \\cdot | \\sin x |}{x}.\n$$\n\n根据重要极限 $\\operatorname* { l i m } _ { x \\to 0 } { \\frac { \\sin x } { x } } = 1$ ，可得\n\n$$\n\\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0 ^ {-}} \\frac {| \\sin x |}{x} = - \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0 ^ {-}} \\frac {\\sin x}{x} = - 1, \\quad \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0 ^ {+}} \\frac {| \\sin x |}{x} = \\lim _ {x \\rightarrow 0 ^ {+}} \\frac {\\sin x}{x} = 1.\n$$\n\n因此我们有 f (0) = − f (0)，故 f (0) = 0",
      "explanationStatus": "sourced_from_aggregate",
